{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57217","headline":"谶 六 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初首不称名，（後周第三主己卯之岁，有一居士，不称姓名，故言不称名）风狂又有声。\n（风狂者，三祖有风病。\n有声者，远近皆知有病，故言有声也。\n）人来不喜见，（人来不喜见，患风之形状）白宝初平平。\n（白宝者，玉也。\n玉边作祭，璨字也。\n三祖名璨大师。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}